sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    participant Provider as Provider (HA or Matter)
    participant CM as CatalogManager
    participant DC as DeviceCatalog
    participant Store as DeviceCatalogStore
    participant RM as RegistryManager
    participant AM as AccessoryManager
    participant HK as HomeKit

    Provider->>CM: synchronizeDiscoveredDevices(devices, source)
    CM->>DC: synchronize(devices, source)

    DC->>DC: add / update discovered devices
    DC->>DC: mark missing only for current source
    DC-->>CM: synchronization result

    CM->>Store: save(catalog)
    Store->>Store: serialize save through saveQueue
    Store->>Store: write temporary file
    Store->>Store: rename temporary file
    Store-->>CM: persisted

    Provider->>RM: rememberPublishedClimateDevices(runtime devices)

    RM->>AM: apply publication changes

    loop each affected device
        AM->>DC: evaluate catalog device / shouldPublish

        alt enabled and not archived
            AM->>HK: create, restore, or update accessory
        else not publishable
            AM->>HK: remove accessory if present
        end
    end

    Note over DC,RM: UI-driven catalog changes can trigger a later refreshFromCatalog()

    RM->>CM: reload catalog
    CM->>Store: load()
    Store-->>CM: persisted devices
    CM-->>RM: current catalog
    RM->>RM: compare catalogPublicationState
    RM->>AM: apply only relevant publication changes
